<title>UK: Ghana cocoa purchases lower at 11,364 in 8th week.</title>
<headline>Ghana cocoa purchases lower at 11,364 in 8th week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana cocoa purchases in the eighth week of the 1996/97 crop season ending December 5 amounted to 11,364 tonnes compared with 18,833 tonnes in the same period of the year-earlier season, the Ghana Cocoa Board said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
